replacement for ANSI.SYS that would support graphics.  I'm talking a
hack-specific ANSI.SYS.  It would translate the hack monster
characters to monster shapes and display them in say VGA.  For
example, when the game output the blue letter a into the screen area
that is the dungeon the new ANSI.SYS would output the shape a soldier
ant.  I dont' know enough about ANSI.SYS to write one myself, but it
